    "Addresses for all 10 trending rows came from GMGN token-link hrefs in the same session, in screenshot order.",
    "smartFlows are 1h per-wallet Smart Inflow card rows from https://gmgn.ai/monitor?chain=sol&tab=smartdegen (Monitor > Smart, 1h), not the left-rail Smart Degen feed or Smart Net Inflow aggregates. usd is the signed 1h net inflow GMGN displayed; some Sell All/Sell Partial rows are still positive (and a few First Buy/Buy More rows negative) because that column is 1h net, not the last fill. Inflow screenshots cover the top screens of the board only (initial plus later scrolls around steps 5 and 7); lower cards were read from the board DOM over 9 scroll steps (the board added no new rows after step 7) and are not in a screenshot. Three inflow rows for 7Kn9…pump had no token symbol shown on the card; token is stored as null and they are disambiguated by tokenCaAbbrev.",
    "walletFull (complete base58) was recorded only when GMGN exposed it (wallet link href, copy button, hover, or equivalent). Card rows often did not expose a full address in the card DOM; rows were given walletFull by matching the row's short wallet label to an exposed /sol/address/ href (9 unique labels in the left rail, of which 6 also appeared on the card grid; none of those 6 were ambiguous). One rail link labelled 4jNT…LwiA once pointed at a 3sVX address and was ignored; the correct 4jNT href was used. Full addresses were not guessed from abbreviations. Some wallet labels are names rather than prefix…suffix abbreviations (for example Stigman, Turzz, Xav). tokenCaAbbrev is included to disambiguate reused tickers (for example one Amika card is ytSQ…pump and another is 6Nka…pump).",
